        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/8b402f779ee6e8f5540eb7b3492db581.avif?t=1759850011\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abstract Wars is a straight shot of adrenaline to the brain!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract Wars is an arcade 2D bullet-hell roguelike where you are just a tiny, but incredibly nimble ship in a universe-sized meat grinder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PURE, UNADULTERATED CHAOS:</strong></u><br>The screen will literally burst from an avalanche of bullets, lasers, explosions and special effects. Dozens of enemies, clouds of shells, myriads of particles - there is no place for boredom here. Only the purest, concentrated chaos that will make your heart beat faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PERFECT BALANCE:</strong></u><br>The controls are intuitive: move and shoot. But to survive in this hell second after second, you'll need god-like reflexes and a cold head. It's incredibly addictive: &quot;one more try&quot; will pull you back again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN STORM:</strong></u><br>The real highlight is the leveling system. After each battle, choose unique skills: from lasers and mines to teleportations that leave a blast wave. Combine them to create a completely unique playstyle: become an invulnerable ghost, a tank obliterating everything in its path, or an unpredictable whirlwind of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash into the thick of this colorful madness, create your legend and become the last warrior standing among the fire and ash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/8b402f779ee6e8f5540eb7b3492db581.avif?t=1759850011\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abstract Wars is a straight shot of adrenaline to the brain!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstract Wars is an arcade 2D bullet-hell roguelike where you are just a tiny, but incredibly nimble ship in a universe-sized meat grinder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PURE, UNADULTERATED CHAOS:</strong></u><br>The screen will literally burst from an avalanche of bullets, lasers, explosions and special effects. Dozens of enemies, clouds of shells, myriads of particles - there is no place for boredom here. Only the purest, concentrated chaos that will make your heart beat faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/fdf3f22a1a7dcd4ac40b5edc4f789a7a.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>PERFECT BALANCE:</strong></u><br>The controls are intuitive: move and shoot. But to survive in this hell second after second, you'll need god-like reflexes and a cold head. It's incredibly addictive: &quot;one more try&quot; will pull you back again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/55cf63a817b9ff21bf12382c55d33451.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>BUILD YOUR OWN STORM:</strong></u><br>The real highlight is the leveling system. After each battle, choose unique skills: from lasers and mines to teleportations that leave a blast wave. Combine them to create a completely unique playstyle: become an invulnerable ghost, a tank obliterating everything in its path, or an unpredictable whirlwind of death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.poster.avif?t=1759850011\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.webm?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038060/extras/c5301e842d75706f9a0a32f4e92c56b8.mp4?t=1759850011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash into the thick of this colorful madness, create your legend and become the last warrior standing among the fire and ash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
